From: Aether Team <dev@aetherbrowser.org>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0010] feat(webui): create persistent top-chrome WebUI controller and host it in BrowserView

This patch:
1. Implements AetherChromeUI extending TopChromeWebUIController.
2. Registers the "aether-chrome" host in the Chrome WebUI factory.
3. Binds the WindowControls Mojo interface under AetherChromeUI.
4. Hosts AetherChromeUI in BrowserView's top container.
